{"id":"u-91b1d509-71e4-40c6-972e-3bb43fb9066b","src":"community","title":"Physical Prowess","author":"Rajbir S.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/Wy2IkT-the-strongest-hero","desc":"This program combines upper-body strength and hypertrophy with lower-body strength and explosiveness, designed for athletic performance, joint resilience, and overall lower-body health.\n\nIt is tailored for athletes who are already satisfied with their current leg size and want to shift their focus away from building lower-body mass. Instead, the primary goal is to develop raw force and explosive power that directly translates to the field. To achieve this, the lower-body programming utilizes heavy squats, central nervous system priming (like Trap Bar Jumps), and essential hamstring isolation to bulletproof the posterior chain.\n\nUnweighted bodyweight plyometrics are intentionally excluded. This program maximizes your time by focusing strictly on loaded movements that require full gym equipment. Unweighted exercises are great, and feel free to add them into your routine. However, I have personally decided to work on those outside of my gym time so I can fully focus on gym-specific exercises to build heavy strength.\n\nNote: To get the most out of this program, remember that sprinting, pogo jumps, and active sports participation outside the gym are vital for fully recruiting your Type-II (fast-twitch) muscle fibers and completing your athletic development.","level":["Intermediate","Beginner"],"goals":["Muscle","Athletics"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":5,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-09-17T18:38:10.643Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Trap Bar Jumps","sets":[{"lo":3,"hi":4,"x":3}]},{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":4,"hi":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Assisted Nordics","sets":[{"lo":3,"hi":4,"x":3}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Rear Delt Fly (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":1